1. The 'hdi' package, version 0.1-10 (archived on CRAN on 2026-07-10;
   tarball hdi_0.1-10.tar.gz, sha256
   15f37a620e2c51b158d50472e442b34391c7eef92acd9291e8d468e14ba49206),
   Copyright (C) Lukas Meier, Ruben Dezeure, Nicolai Meinshausen,
