   (any version) and redistributed here under GPL-3.

   Derived files: R/nodewise_api.R, R/nodewise_tuning.R, R/nodewise_znz.R,
   R/nodewise_final.R (from hdi's R/helpers.nodewise.R, written by Ruben
   Dezeure), and the files of the lasso.proj()/boot.lasso.proj() port
   (from hdi's R/lasso-proj.R, R/boot.lasso-proj.R, R/helpers.R and
   R/methods.R), which are marked as such in their headers.

   Modifications (GPL-3 section 5a): the code was split into smaller files,
   the Z&Z switch of the nodewise lasso became an explicit argument, the
   cross-validation folds can be supplied, parallel execution uses a common
   helper, messages are printed only when verbose = TRUE, unreachable
   branches were removed, argument checks were added, and further changes are
   listed in NEWS.md. The numerical computations of the hdi-compatible code
   paths are unchanged.

2. The scaled lasso (R/scaled_lasso.R) is an independent implementation of the
   algorithm of Sun and Zhang (2012, Biometrika 99:879-898) with the penalty
   level of Sun and Zhang (2013, JMLR 14:3385-3418). Its numerical conventions
   were chosen to agree with the archived 'scalreg' package (version 1.0.1,
   Copyright (C) Tingni Sun, GPL-2); no code of scalreg is included.

3. The column standardisation used in ST() (R/st_screen.R) is an independent
   base-R implementation; no code of the 'SIS' package is included.
